  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 225 * 25 * 3 * 3 * 6 * 6\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1): ÷ × = − +\n\n225 * 25 * 3 * 3 * 6 * 6 ⇒ 225 ÷ 25 × 3 = 3 - 6 + 6\n\n⇒ __**225 ÷**____** 25**__ × 3 = __**3 + 6**__ - 6\n\n⇒ __**9**____** ×**____** 3**__ = __**9 - 6**__\n\n⇒ 27 ≠ 3 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2): ÷ × + − =\n\n225 * 25 * 3 * 3 * 6 * 6 ⇒ 225 ÷ 25 × 3 + 3 - 6 = 6\n\n⇒ __**225 ÷**____** 25**__ × 3 + 3 - 6 = 6\n\n⇒ __**9**____** ×**____** 3**__ + 3 - 6 = 6\n\n⇒ __**27**____** + 3**__ - 6 = 6\n\n⇒ __**30 - 6**__ = 6\n\n⇒ 24 ≠ 6 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3): ÷ = ×− + \n\n225 * 25 * 3 * 3 * 6 * 6 ⇒ 225 ÷ 25 = 3 × 3 - 6 + 6\n\n⇒ __**225 ÷**____** 25**__ = __**3 **____**×**____** 3**__ - 6 + 6\n\n⇒ 9 = __**9 + 6**__ - 6\n\n⇒ 9 = __15____** - 6**__\n\n**⇒ 9 = 9 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 4): ÷ ×− + = \n\n225 * 25 * 3 * 3 * 6 * 6 ⇒ 225 ÷ 25 × 3 - 3 + 6 = 6\n\n⇒ __**225 ÷**____** 25**__ × 3 - 3 + 6 = 6\n\n⇒ __**9**____** ×**____** 3**__ - 3 + 6 = 6\n\n⇒ __**27 + 6**__ - 3 = 6\n\n⇒ __30____** - 3**__ = 6\n\n⇒ 27 ≠ 6 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
